*LTspice
*
*TLV76701
*Adjustable- and fixed-output, 1-A, 16-V, positive-voltage low-dropout (LDO) linear regulator
*AE01005701
*
*netlist
.include TLV76701.cir
*
*params
.param RADJ=51.1K

*
*load regulation
*.param RREF=16.2K
*.param VSOURCE=16
*.param ILOAD=1
*.dc I1 0.1 {ILOAD} 1m
*
*line regulation
.param RREF=16.2K
.step param RREF list 102K 16.2K 9.76K 3.65K
.param VSOURCE=16
.param ILOAD=0.1
.dc V1 0 {VSOURCE} 1m
*
*vout regulation
*.param VSOURCE=16
*.param ILOAD=0.5
*.dc V1 0 {VSOURCE} 1m
*.op
*
*.backanno
*.op
